# A chat on a computer: a picture picked into its composer with words in it: the box opens for it, the picture growing
# with the room it opens, whole (docs/motion.md: what is put in the composer).
# MBUI_FIXTURE=webdemo MBUI_WIN=1280x800.
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tap 把那个弄一下
wait 900
tap 发消息
wait 700
type 看看，
wait 300
picks 截图.png:4000
key cmd+u
wait 1200
exit
